2024-01-01 * "a posting in a commodity the open does not list"
  Assets:Bank 10 EUR
  Equity:Free -10 EUR

2024-01-02 * "a posting in a listed commodity"
  Assets:Bank 5 USD
  Equity:Free -5 USD

2024-01-03 * "a cost in another commodity: only the units count"
  Assets:Broker 2 AAPL {5 EUR}
  Equity:Free -10 EUR

2024-01-04 * "a price in another commodity: only the units count"
  Assets:Bank 11 USD @ 0.9 EUR
  Equity:Free -9.9 EUR

2024-01-05 * "two offending postings"
  Assets:Bank 1 EUR
  Assets:Bank 2 EUR
  Equity:Free -3 EUR

2024-01-06 * "an elided amount, inferred in another commodity"
  Assets:Bank
  Equity:Free -4 EUR

2024-01-07 * "a sub-account and an account opened without commodities"
  Assets:Bank:Savings 3 EUR
  Assets:Any 3 EUR
  Equity:Free -6 EUR

